witcheryextras.wolf.restricted=Your beast form cannot hold or wear this!
witchery.rite.greaterformcontrol=Rite of Greater Form Control{r||After reaching the limits of the werewolf form, your arcane knowledge has given you insights into improving your abilities further. With this rite you reshape your paws to resemble hands, letting you finally hold items as a werewolf. This does not carry into the wolf form, where you simply grip the item in your muzzle. Perform it at werewolf level 10, under the night sky, while shifted into the wolfman form.
witcheryextras.rite.greaterformcontrol.refused=The spirits reject you. Only a werewolf of the tenth night, untouched by vampiric blood, may attempt this rite.
witcheryextras.rite.greaterformcontrol.already=You have already walked this path. Your body remembers.
witcheryextras.rite.greaterformcontrol.notready=Your form is not yet perfected. Reach the tenth night of the wolf before attempting this rite.
witcheryextras.rite.greaterformcontrol.shift=Shift into your wolfman form within the circle to begin the transformation.
witcheryextras.rite.greaterformcontrol.stage2=The spirits circle you... hold the wolfman form and let the change take hold.
witcheryextras.rite.greaterformcontrol.completed=Your hands twist into claws that still remember their shape. You have mastered the greater form - the werewolf now wields what a man would.
witchery.rite.formmastery=Rite of Form Mastery{r||Further experimentation into shape control has revealed how to reshape your body while still keeping your blessings. With this rite the armor of civilization finally fits your werewolf frame, and you may sleep in a bed once more. The wolf form remains a beast - it still cannot wear armor or rest. Perform it at werewolf level 11, under the night sky, while shifted into the wolfman form.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.refused=The spirits reject you. Only a pure-blooded werewolf who has mastered the greater form may attempt this rite.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.already=Your body is already perfected. Another mastery there is not to be found.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.notready=Your control is not yet deep enough. Master the greater form before attempting this rite.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.shift=Shift into your wolfman form within the circle to begin the reshaping.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.stage2=The spirits weave through your frame... hold the wolfman form and let the body settle.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.completed=Your body yields and reshapes itself. You are the greater form - the armor of civilization now fits the beast, and you may rest as one, while its powers remain yours.
witcheryextras.lilith.warding.notvampire=Lilith turns the focus over in her hands. "Warding is the art of turning harm away, little one... but you have no blood for me to teach. Come back when you have known the long night."
witcheryextras.lilith.warding.notready=Lilith smiles faintly. "So you wish to master my warding? I have spent centuries bending this craft to hold the sun's curse at bay. Bring me this focus when your blood has drunk deep of ten nights, and I will show you what I have learned."
witcheryextras.lilith.warding.hybrid=Lilith recoils, hissing. "Abomination! Your blood is torn between the wolf and the night - no warding of mine can settle such a war. Begone."
witcheryextras.lilith.warding.ascended=Lilith traces the focus across your brow, whispering words of warding. "The sun wound you no longer. Walk beneath its gaze, child of the night - and sparkle a little, it angers the hunters." Your blood shudders and deepens. (Twilight Vampire attained)
